DESCRIPTION:Join Pisgah Area SORBA for a Women's Trail Work Day on Mon day
 \, August 24\, from 5:30–7:30 PM ! Come spend an evening giving back to 
 the trails\, meeting other women who love the outdoors\, and enjoying some
  time by the river. We'll be brushing back vegetation along the Davidson R
 iver Trail to improve the trail corridor and keep this popular trail looki
 ng its best. We'll meet at the Cove Creek Trailhead \, making it easy to c
 ool off with a swim in the Davidson River after the work is done. To top i
 t all off\, we'll fire up the grill afterward and enjoy some food and cold
  drinks together by the river! Date: Monday\, August 24th Time: 5:30 PM 
 – 7:30 PM Trail Work Location: Davidson River Trail Meetup Location: Cov
 e Creek Trailhead No trail work experience is necessary. We'll provide the
  tools\, ins\n\nMore: https://www.pisgahareasorba.org/\n\nSource: Pisgah A
 rea SORBA\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
LOCATION:75MM+66 Brevard\, North Carolina\, USA\, 75MM+66 Brevard
URL:https://www.pisgahareasorba.org/
END:VEVENT
