CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:We Shred Rock Creek is back for 2026 – and it is shaping up 
 to be one heck of a good time on bikes. Whether you’re looking to progre
 ss\, try a new trail\, ride Rock Creek (or any bike park!) for the first t
 ime\, or just hang out and have a beverage with other rad women+\, this ev
 ent is for you! Women+ and Girls Take Over Rock Creek! No matter your skil
 l level\, showing up and riding any mountain bike park can be a little int
 imidating\, especially if you don't have a friend to ride with. That’s w
 hy we’re extending an invite out to women+ of all ages to join us at Roc
 k Creek – without racing or egos – to have fun on the trails and progr
 ess at your own pace. Join pro downhill racer/ MTB skills coach/ mom Carol
 ine Washam for a chill day of doing what we all love: riding bikes\, talki
 ng about bikes\, a\n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/we-shred-rock-creek\n\n
 Source: BikeReg\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
