DESCRIPTION:Regular season with races starting in early March. Typically 5
 -6 races across North Carolina. January includes 2-4 indoor training oppor
 tunities on spin bikes and gym exercises. February has 1 weekend practice 
 per week for 2 hours. March-May has 2 rides per week: 1-2 weeknights after
  5pm (1.5 hours) and weekend day practice alternating Saturdays and Sunday
 s (2 hours).\n\nMore: https://www.pisgahrage.com/\n\nSource: Pisgah Rage (
