BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pisgah Mountain Bike Adventure Race
DTSTART:20270501T040000Z
DTEND:20270501T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20260817T185532Z
UID:996261671a499518@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:The Pisgah Mountain Bike Adventure Race (PMBAR) is the absolut
 e pinnacle of MTB Adventure Racing. A mix of brutal and beautiful\, this t
 est of spirit and camaraderie tasks teams of two racers to reach 4 of 5 ch
 eckpoints\, in any order\, and return to the start/finish as fast as possi
 ble. The team with the lowest overall time wins. Checkpoint locations rema
 in secret until start-time and there is no suggested route. Routes vary be
 tween 50-80 miles\, include 9\,000-15\,000 feet of climbing\, and take 7-1
 4 hours to complete. PMBAR is held deep in the Pisgah National Forest\, on
 e of the most beautiful\, rugged\, and unforgiving areas in the nation. Th
 ere will be little to no water or food support on course. Once you leave t
 he start/finish you are on your own. There will be no drops\, sag wagons\,
  or other \n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/pisgah-mountain-bike-adventure-
 race-2027\n\nSource: BikeReg\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/cale
 ndar
GEO:35.2830246;-82.7218935
LOCATION:1284 Pisgah Hwy\, Pisgah Forest\, NC
URL:http://www.BikeReg.com/pisgah-mountain-bike-adventure-race-2027
END:VEVENT
